# Stage all, write a summary and a description, commit with Enter, then check the cleared composer. The harness
# fixes the commit date, so SHAs are stable. The footer notice expires, so it is masked.
fixture demo
wait text "Working Changes"
click 150 3
snapshot staged-all
key c
text "Add everything"
key tab
text "Second line"
snapshot typed
key tab
key enter
wait stable
mask 0 47 160 1
snapshot committed
